# Nothing that is not the published app belongs in this repository.
# The audit of 27 July 2026 found a deleted customer build still recoverable
# from history with a live password record in it. A file removed in a later
# commit is still public forever, so the only reliable control is never
# committing it.

# Server code — the rules live here and must never be published
worker.js
scan_engine.js*
grading_engine.js
make_beta.py
build_*.py
verify_*.js
*.cjs

# Credentials of any kind
*.env
.env*
*token*.txt
*secret*
*.pem
*.key
wrangler.toml
.git-credentials

# Customer-specific builds (this is the exact class of file that leaked)
*locked*.html
*-backup.html
index-v*.html

# Working files
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
